  "prompt": "LedgerLoop's support team works on Brussels time. How many app sessions started on each Brussels day from Monday 20 to Sunday 26 October 2025 (both days included)? A session belongs to the Brussels day of its first event's moment. Work the gaps out over every app event. A user's first app event starts a session, and an event more than 30 minutes after the same user's previous event starts a new one; an event exactly 30 minutes later stays in the same session. Measure each gap as the time between the two moments in event_ts, a UTC instant, never between clock times. Return two columns, in this order: brussels_day and sessions. Return one row for each Brussels day with at least one session start. Any row order is fine.",
  "output_contract": {
    "columns": [
      {
        "name": "brussels_day",
        "type_class": "temporal"
      },
      {
        "name": "sessions",
        "type_class": "numeric"
      }
